  "label": "Osama bin Laden Identity",
  "description": "The image of Osama bin Laden is not just a visual element but a powerful symbol of global terrorism. His identity as the leader of al-Qaeda and the orchestrator of the 9/11 attacks is essential background knowledge to understand why the meme uses his image to deliver its message. The meme implies that jokes about Muslims are dangerous because they might provoke violent retaliation — a reference to the real-world consequences of terrorism and the association of Muslims with it.",
